msgid "Your credit score, made fair."
msgstr "तपाईंको क्रेडिट स्कोर, निष्पक्ष बनायो।"

msgid ""
"FairCreditScore is an alternative credit scoring platform for the 400+ "
"million Indians who transact every day on UPI but stay invisible to "
"traditional bureaus. Powered by FairCreditAI and the RBI Account Aggregator "
"framework."
msgstr ""
"FairCreditScore 400+ मिलियन भारतीयहरूका लागि एक वैकल्पिक क्रेडिट स्कोरिङ "
"प्लेटफर्म हो जसले हरेक दिन UPI ​​मा कारोबार गर्छन् तर परम्परागत ब्यूरोहरूमा "
"अदृश्य रहन्छन्। FairCreditAI र RBI खाता एग्रीगेटर फ्रेमवर्क द्वारा संचालित।"

msgid "Individual Customer"
msgstr "व्यक्तिगत ग्राहक"

msgid ""
"Generate your FairCreditScore in seconds. Upload a bank statement and see "
"what helped or hurt your score."
msgstr ""
"सेकेन्डमा आफ्नो FairCreditScore उत्पन्न गर्नुहोस्। बैंक स्टेटमेन्ट अपलोड "
"गर्नुहोस् र हेर्नुहोस् कुन कुराले तपाईंको स्कोरलाई मद्दत गर्यो वा हानि "
"गर्यो।"

msgid "Get my score"
msgstr "मेरो स्कोर प्राप्त गर्नुहोस्"

msgid "Financial Institutions"
msgstr "वित्तीय संस्थाहरू"

msgid ""
"Operations console for partner banks and NBFCs &mdash; onboard customers, "
"generate scores on their behalf."
msgstr ""
"साझेदार बैंक र NBFCs को लागि सञ्चालन कन्सोल &mdash; जहाजमा रहेका ग्राहकहरू, "
"तिनीहरूको तर्फबाट स्कोरहरू उत्पन्न गर्नुहोस्।"

msgid "Request access"
msgstr "पहुँच अनुरोध गर्नुहोस्"

msgid "Consent-based"
msgstr "सहमतिमा आधारित"

msgid ""
"Share data once via the RBI-licensed Account Aggregator framework. No screen"
" scraping, no document hassle."
msgstr ""
"Share data once via the RBI-licensed Account Aggregator framework. No screen"
" scraping, no document hassle."

msgid "Explainable"
msgstr "व्याख्या गर्न सकिने"

msgid ""
"Every score comes with a SHAP-style breakdown of what helped or hurt &mdash;"
" no black box."
msgstr ""
"प्रत्येक स्कोर SHAP-शैली ब्रेकडाउनको साथ आउँदछ जसले मद्दत गर्यो वा चोट "
"पुर्यायो &mdash; कालो बक्स छैन।"

msgid "Inclusive"
